<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά-ψυξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cooling</i> or <i>becoming cold, chill</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ μετὰ καταψύξιος δυσφορίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					1.27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Coac.</u>
				337
			</span></i>, al.: freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ φόβος κ. δι᾽ ὀλιγαιμότητά ἐστι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PA</u>
					692a23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1389b32
			</span></i>; simply, <i>cold</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.8.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώνειον</span>
			 (from its effect), Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.78
			</span></i>.</div>
